{"displayStem":"그림은 동일한 좌심실에서 두 조건 Ⅰ과 Ⅱ의 압력-용적 고리를 나타낸 모식도이다. 판막 역류와 단락은 없다. 이완기말 용적과 대동맥판막이 열리는 압력은 두 조건에서 같다. 세로 구간은 등용적 단계, 오른쪽에서 왼쪽으로 진행하는 위쪽 곡선은 박출 단계이다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"교육 목적으로 구성한 학습자료입니다."}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence \"><div class=\"evidence\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 580 310\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"좌심실 용적 (mL)와 좌심실 압력 (mmHg) 비교 그래프\"><path d=\"M60 45V245H520\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\"></path><path d=\"M60 245v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"60\" y=\"270\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><path d=\"M285 245v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"285\" y=\"270\" text-anchor=\"middle\">75</text><path d=\"M510 245v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"510\" y=\"270\" text-anchor=\"middle\">150</text><text x=\"53\" y=\"249\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><text x=\"53\" y=\"151.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">80</text><text x=\"53\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"end\">160</text><polyline points=\"210,241.34375 216.999,241.29621875 224.001,241.24503125 231,241.18775 237.999,241.124375 245.001,241.0536875 252,240.9756875 258.999,240.890375 266.001,240.79653125 273,240.69171875 279.999,240.5759375 287.00100000000003,240.44796875 294,240.30659375 300.999,240.15059375 308.001,239.97753125 315,239.78740625 321.99899999999997,239.5765625 329.001,239.34378125 336,239.086625 342.999,238.80265625 350.00100000000003,238.48821875 357,238.140875 363.999,237.75696875 371.00100000000003,237.33284375 378,236.863625 384.99899999999997,236.34565625 392.001,235.77284375 399,235.13909375 405.99899999999997,234.43953125 413.001,233.66684375 420,232.8125 420,224.28125 420,215.75 420,207.21875 420,198.6875 420,190.15625 420,181.625 420,173.09375 420,164.5625 420,156.03125 420,147.5 414.75,143.848625 409.5,140.21796875 404.25,136.62753125 399,133.09925 393.75,129.652625 388.5,126.30593749999998 383.25,123.07990625 378,119.99037499999999 372.75,117.05440625000001 367.5,114.29028124999999 362.25,111.712625 357,109.33362499999998 351.75,107.1691249999999